<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-architectural-blue mb-4">Care &amp; Maintenance Guide</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Protecting the timeless beauty of Athangudi tiles requires precision and artisanal care. Our comprehensive guide ensures your cement tiles age gracefully, developing a rich patina over generations.
            </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
<!-- Left Navigation (Vertical) -->
<aside class="md:col-span-3 sticky top-32 space-y-2">
<p class="font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-6 border-b border-outline-variant pb-2">Technical Portal</p>
<button class="w-full text-left p-4 rounded-lg flex items-center gap-3 group transition-all hover:bg-surface-container active:bg-surface-variant" id="btn-daily" onclick="scrollToSection('daily-care')">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-architectural-blue">cleaning_services</span>
<span class="font-body-md font-semibold">Daily Care</span>
</button>
